---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';

const title = 'Stripchat Alternatives in 2026: Compare Other Live-Cam Models';
const description = 'Research alternatives to Stripchat while keeping the current monetizable partner path clear and transparent.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pageType="Article">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/live-cams">Live Cams</a><span>/</span><span>Stripchat Alternatives</span></nav>
      <span class="kicker">Alternatives guide · September 2026</span>
      <h1>Stripchat Alternatives</h1>
      <p class="lead">If Stripchat is not obviously right for you, compare whether you actually want another public-room model or a more premium/private-interaction experience.</p>
      <div class="disclosure"><strong>Commercial note:</strong> Stripchat remains our current affiliate partner. Competing brands are compared through StripUnion’s own pages until separate affiliate relationships are approved.</div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_alternatives_hero" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell narrow">
    <div class="money-grid">
      <article class="money-card"><span class="kicker">Public-room comparison</span><h3>Chaturbate</h3><p>Useful if you want to compare another public-room-first model.</p><a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-vs-chaturbate">Compare on StripUnion →</a></article>
      <article class="money-card"><span class="kicker">Premium-style comparison</span><h3>LiveJasmin</h3><p>Useful if your real question is whether you want a more premium/private-interaction-oriented experience.</p><a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-vs-livejasmin">Compare on StripUnion →</a></article>
      <article class="money-card"><span class="partner-badge">Current partner</span><h3>Stay with Stripchat</h3><p>If broad discovery and optional token spending still fit, there may be no reason to switch.</p><AffiliateButton source="stripchat_alternatives_card" /></article>
    </div>

    <section class="article-body">
      <section><h2>Alternatives pages are about the reason you want to switch</h2><p>Someone searching for an alternative may be dissatisfied with discovery, spending model, privacy controls, premium feel or simply wants to compare before committing. Matching that reason is more useful than listing ten brands.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Keep the comparison inside StripUnion</h2><p>We use competing brands to answer the search intent, but do not donate outbound traffic to them without an affiliate relationship. This keeps the research useful while preserving the commercial value of the visitor.</p></section>
    </section>

    <section class="conversion-strip">
      <div><span class="kicker">Still a fit?</span><h2>Return to Stripchat when the comparison confirms it.</h2><p>If your research shows that Stripchat’s public-room and token model is still what you want, use the tracked partner link.</p></div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_alternatives_bottom" />
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
